{"annotations":[],"blockId":"bixiu-xia","blockTitle":"必修下","body":"*选自《张孝祥词校笺》卷一（中华书局2010 年版）。张孝祥（1132—1170），字安国，号于湖居士，乌江（今安徽和县东北）人，南宋词人。宋孝宗乾道二年（1166），张孝祥因人进谗言而被罢官，由桂林北归，途经洞庭湖时作此词。\n\n念奴娇·过洞庭\n\n张孝祥\n\n洞庭青草[1]，近中秋，更无一点风色[2]。\n\n玉鉴琼田[3]三万顷，着我扁舟一叶。\n\n素月分辉，明河共影，表里俱澄澈[4]。\n\n悠然心会[5]，妙处难与君说。\n\n应念岭海经年，孤光自照，肝肺皆冰雪[6]。\n\n短发萧骚[7]襟袖冷，稳泛沧浪空阔。\n\n尽挹[8]西江[9]，细斟北斗[10]，万象为宾客。\n\n扣舷独啸，不知今夕何夕[11]！\n\n词人罢官北归，时近中秋，途经洞庭，写了这首词来描摹洞庭月色，并抒发自己的怀抱。万顷湖面上，作者荡一叶扁舟，扣舷独啸，看起来极为渺小。但是，他“肝肺皆冰雪”的胸怀，与洞庭月下“表里俱澄澈”的气象交融；他包罗天地万象的想象，与浩渺无限的自然融合，超越了世俗的宠辱得失。诵读这首词，想象其中恢宏的意境，体会词人高洁的人格。","contentVersion":"yw-3e77f0f7ffa5d042a6d06763","createdAt":"2024-08-22T14:36:37Z","derivedAuthor":"张孝祥","derivedFrom":"lesson-1755","excerpt":"*选自《张孝祥词校笺》卷一（中华书局2010 年版）。 张孝祥（1132—1170），字安国，号于湖居士，乌江（今安徽和县东北）人，南宋词人。宋孝宗乾道二年（1166），张孝祥因人进谗言而被罢官，由桂林北归，途经洞庭湖时作此词。 \n念奴娇·过洞庭\n张孝祥 \n洞庭青草 [1] ，近中秋，更无一点风色 [2] 。\n玉鉴琼田 [3] 三万顷，着我扁舟一叶。\n素月分辉，明河共影，表里俱澄澈 [4] 。\n悠然心会 [5] ，妙处难与君说。\n应念岭海经年，孤光自照，肝肺皆冰雪 [6] 。\n短发萧骚 [7] 襟袖冷，稳泛沧浪空阔。\n尽挹 [8] 西江 [9] ，细斟北斗 [10] ，万象为宾客。\n扣舷独啸，不知今夕何夕 [11] ！\n词人罢官北归，时近中秋，途经洞庭，写了这首词来描摹洞庭月色，并抒发自己的怀抱。万顷湖面上，作者荡一叶扁舟，扣舷独啸，看起来极为渺小。但是，他“肝肺皆冰雪”的胸怀，与洞庭月下“表里俱澄澈”的气象交融；他包罗天地万象的想象，与浩渺无限的自然融合，超越了世俗的宠辱得失。诵读这首词，想象其中恢宏的意境，体会词人高洁的人格。","forumImages":[],"forumUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/t/topic/1755","id":"lesson-1755-p3","learningTasks":[],"postCount":1,"posts":[{"attachments":[],"created_at":"2024-08-22T14:44:38Z","id":"11210-3","images":[],"like_count":0,"links":[{"classes":"anchor","has_image":false,"href":"#p-11210-h-1","text":"#p-11210-h-1","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11210-1","text":"[1]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11210-2","text":"[2]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11210-3","text":"[3]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11210-4","text":"[4]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11210-5","text":"[5]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11210-6","text":"[6]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11210-7","text":"[7]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11210-8","text":"[8]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11210-9","text":"[9]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11210-10","text":"[10]","title":""},{"has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-11210-11","text":"[11]","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-1","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-2","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-3","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-4","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-5","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-6","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-7","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-8","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-9","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-10","text":"↩︎","title":""},{"classes":"footnote-backref","has_image":false,"href":"#footnote-ref-11210-11","text":"↩︎","title":""}],"plainText":"*选自《张孝祥词校笺》卷一（中华书局2010 年版）。 张孝祥（1132—1170），字安国，号于湖居士，乌江（今安徽和县东北）人，南宋词人。宋孝宗乾道二年（1166），张孝祥因人进谗言而被罢官，由桂林北归，途经洞庭湖时作此词。 \n念奴娇·过洞庭\n张孝祥 \n洞庭青草 [1] ，近中秋，更无一点风色 [2] 。\n玉鉴琼田 [3] 三万顷，着我扁舟一叶。\n素月分辉，明河共影，表里俱澄澈 [4] 。\n悠然心会 [5] ，妙处难与君说。\n应念岭海经年，孤光自照，肝肺皆冰雪 [6] 。\n短发萧骚 [7] 襟袖冷，稳泛沧浪空阔。\n尽挹 [8] 西江 [9] ，细斟北斗 [10] ，万象为宾客。\n扣舷独啸，不知今夕何夕 [11] ！\n词人罢官北归，时近中秋，途经洞庭，写了这首词来描摹洞庭月色，并抒发自己的怀抱。万顷湖面上，作者荡一叶扁舟，扣舷独啸，看起来极为渺小。但是，他“肝肺皆冰雪”的胸怀，与洞庭月下“表里俱澄澈”的气象交融；他包罗天地万象的想象，与浩渺无限的自然融合，超越了世俗的宠辱得失。诵读这首词，想象其中恢宏的意境，体会词人高洁的人格。","post_number":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"updated_at":"2024-08-22T14:44:38Z"}],"readerDocument":{"curationManifestSha256":"98e90b3603b34b437bc554810c21f01c4db44d10364211af114d30fde3d67bad","curationVersion":"2026-07-30.2","lessonId":"lesson-1755-p3","main":{"annotations":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"青草，即青草湖，在今湖南岳阳西南，属南洞庭湖。南朝宋盛弘之《荆州记》载：“巴陵南有青草湖，周回数百里，日月出没其中。”","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11210-1"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"风色，风。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11210-2"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"玉鉴琼田，形容月光下洞庭湖皎洁的水面。鉴，镜子。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11210-3"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"素月分辉，明河共影，表里俱澄澈，意思是明月光辉四射，银河与明月一同映入湖水之中，上上下下全都清亮明洁。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11210-4"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"悠然心会，指内心优游自在，与眼前景物相合。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11210-5"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"应念岭海经年，孤光自照，肝肺皆冰雪，意思是应思量在岭外一年左右的官场生活中，月光本就在照耀陪伴，自己的心胸全部像冰雪一样明洁。岭海，五岭至南海之间的地域，指今两广一带。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11210-6"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"萧骚，稀疏。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11210-7"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"挹（yì），舀（水）。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11210-8"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"西江，长江。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11210-9"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"细斟北斗，意思是用天上的北斗舀取长江水细细品酌。北斗，北斗七星，排列成斗勺形，比喻酒器。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11210-10"},{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"不知今夕何夕，这里是极度赞叹此夜之美好。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"noteId":"footnote-11210-11"}],"blocks":[{"level":2,"runs":[{"text":"念奴娇·过洞庭","type":"text"}],"type":"heading"},{"runs":[{"text":"张孝祥","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"洞庭青草","type":"text"},{"label":"[1]","noteId":"footnote-11210-1","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，近中秋，更无一点风色","type":"text"},{"label":"[2]","noteId":"footnote-11210-2","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。\n\n玉鉴琼田","type":"text"},{"label":"[3]","noteId":"footnote-11210-3","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"三万顷，着我扁舟一叶。\n\n素月分辉，明河共影，表里俱澄澈","type":"text"},{"label":"[4]","noteId":"footnote-11210-4","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。\n\n悠然心会","type":"text"},{"label":"[5]","noteId":"footnote-11210-5","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，妙处难与君说。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"应念岭海经年，孤光自照，肝肺皆冰雪","type":"text"},{"label":"[6]","noteId":"footnote-11210-6","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"。\n\n短发萧骚","type":"text"},{"label":"[7]","noteId":"footnote-11210-7","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"襟袖冷，稳泛沧浪空阔。\n\n尽挹","type":"text"},{"label":"[8]","noteId":"footnote-11210-8","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"西江","type":"text"},{"label":"[9]","noteId":"footnote-11210-9","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，细斟北斗","type":"text"},{"label":"[10]","noteId":"footnote-11210-10","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"，万象为宾客。\n\n扣舷独啸，不知今夕何夕","type":"text"},{"label":"[11]","noteId":"footnote-11210-11","type":"annotation-ref"},{"text":"！","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"runs":[{"text":"词人罢官北归，时近中秋，途经洞庭，写了这首词来描摹洞庭月色，并抒发自己的怀抱。万顷湖面上，作者荡一叶扁舟，扣舷独啸，看起来极为渺小。但是，他“肝肺皆冰雪”的胸怀，与洞庭月下“表里俱澄澈”的气象交融；他包罗天地万象的想象，与浩渺无限的自然融合，超越了世俗的宠辱得失。诵读这首词，想象其中恢宏的意境，体会词人高洁的人格。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"frontMatter":[{"blocks":[{"runs":[{"text":"*选自《张孝祥词校笺》卷一（中华书局2010 年版）。张孝祥（1132—1170），字安国，号于湖居士，乌江（今安徽和县东北）人，南宋词人。宋孝宗乾道二年（1166），张孝祥因人进谗言而被罢官，由桂林北归，途经洞庭湖时作此词。","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"quote"}],"guidance":[],"links":[],"media":[],"sourceOnlyBlocks":[],"sourcePostId":"11210-3","sourcePostNumber":1},"mediaReceiptLedgerSha256":"5487243dd8d14d65dfadc20ed544a999aaa318fc20c291462ea62c69e1eff320","mediaReceiptLedgerVersion":"2026-07-30.2","provenance":{"links":[{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#p-11210-h-1","postId":"11210-3","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#p-11210-h-1","text":"#p-11210-h-1","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11210-1","postId":"11210-3","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11210-1","text":"[1]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11210-2","postId":"11210-3","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11210-2","text":"[2]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11210-3","postId":"11210-3","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11210-3","text":"[3]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11210-4","postId":"11210-3","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11210-4","text":"[4]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11210-5","postId":"11210-3","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11210-5","text":"[5]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11210-6","postId":"11210-3","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11210-6","text":"[6]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11210-7","postId":"11210-3","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11210-7","text":"[7]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11210-8","postId":"11210-3","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11210-8","text":"[8]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11210-9","postId":"11210-3","postNumber":1,"postRole":"primary","sourceUrl":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11210-9","text":"[9]","title":null},{"disposition":"internal","href":"https://forum.rdfzer.com/#footnote-11210-10","postId":"11210-3","p